# additional build context (docker/Dockerfile mounts it as /jdtls-local).
# Download the actual snapshot here, through the system proxy:
#   var/jdtls/jdt-language-server.tar.gz   (from download.eclipse.org /jdtls/snapshots/...)
# The tarball is git-ignored; only this placeholder is tracked.